{"id": "DdeVVlpT9zW", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"CLAUDE\" to get this Free Tool to run Claude Code with almost unlimited usage.\n\nYou can now run Claude Code for completely free, with almost unlimited usage.\n\nSomeone on GitHub just built an AI tool that gives you over 7 billion free AI tokens every single month.\n\nAnd that includes models from ChatGPT, Gemini, GLM, Kimi, Grok, Mistral, Qwen, and much more.\nIt's called FreeLLMAPI.\n\nIt links your Claude Code to over 600 free AI models, all through one single setup.\n\nSo the moment your Claude limit runs out, it automatically switches you to the next best model.\n\nYour session just keeps going without any interruption.\n\nPlus it leaves behind a note as it switches.\n\nSo the new model already has your whole context, and you don't have to re-explain anything.\n\nThink of it like handing off a project to a coworker with a full briefing already attached.\n\nMost tools that switch models lose your context the moment they swap.\nThis one hands it off cleanly instead.\n\n#claudecode #freellmapi #omniroute #githubrepo #claudeai", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1789831818, "like_count": 24171, "comment_count": 35772, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2310421129804963a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.1, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNvDU-4ScjEP0VhoE8pdHX9bENbsmxq4Jug4mulDFC9luk3IqLrWGfLSRMo_G6BUfRuNYgUxnKmMZpHFVC0ORJZ1_OKTPPqvfFHia0.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=Adqq2T1eYxwIC7gLF2iXPS1cmmhFjJBUxra1jXBUejlTJ4TzKuvMMsOxWZjQmgG8TDk&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=8MJHgIL-0LsQ7kNvwHK4Q_g&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=aVC98CsKxM_uQRHnuO1PTg&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQS1spxCnoXpeWBn2HgVdVfTv